 "kit": "A Swamp Fighter of the reed marshes, sworn to no nation: a short cape of woven dry straw-coloured reeds over the shoulders, a hood of undyed grey wool worn up, a padded jerkin of tan linen, worn under a sleeveless surcoat of undyed grey wool that covers his whole chest and belly from the collar down to just below the knees, front and back, split at the front below the belt so the legs can stride and held at the waist by a belt; forearms wrapped in strips of cloth; legs wrapped to the knee in mud-stained leather; a long fishing spear with a barbed iron head, its shaft bound with reed cord. No shield. The reeds are dry and tan, never green; no colours but grey, tan, straw, leather brown and iron.",
